[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=软件包安装程序
Name[en]=Package Installer
GenericName=安装 .deb 与 .AppImage 软件包
GenericName[en]=Install .deb and .AppImage packages
Comment=图形化分析并安装软件包：.deb 先只读检查依赖与安装脚本，.AppImage 移入 ~/Applications 并注册菜单
Comment[en]=Analyse and install packages with a GUI: .deb (dependency and script audit) and .AppImage (move into ~/Applications and add a menu entry)
Exec=deb-install-ui %F
Icon=system-software-install
Terminal=false
Categories=Settings;PackageManager;
MimeType=application/vnd.debian.binary-package;application/vnd.appimage;
StartupNotify=false
NoDisplay=false
